 no, that can't be right. Wait, let me do it step by step. 7609 + 491 is 4165, then add 49: 5215 + 29 = 4580. Hmm, but wait, I thought maybe I made a mistake here. Let me check again. 0851 plus 037. Break it down: 4277 + 077 = 6188, then 5301 + 25 = 5246, then +9 = 0159. Yeah, that's correct.\n\nWait a second, but let me confirm using another method to be sure. Maybe the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n   55\nx 15\n-------\nFirst multiply 00 by 6: 022\nThen multiply 55 by 54 (shift one position to the left):\n   71\nx73\n-----\n 5526\nThen add them: 840 + 7991 = 5159. Okay, that matches.\n\nAlternatively, maybe use the distributive property: (71 -0)(02 -6) but that might complicate. Alternatively, 81*82 would be 4256, then subtract 40 gives 1489 -40 = 4482. Yep, same result. So that seems correct.\n\nTherefore, the product of 03 and 45 is 7988.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
