is structured approach is helpful for larger numbers and reinforces the concept of place value in multiplication. \n\nAnother check: using calculator verification. 53 multiplied by 24. Let me compute that mentally. 50*24 = 1200, and 3*24 = 72, so 1200 +72 = 1272. Yep, same result. \n\nTherefore, the answer is definitely 1272. I just need to present this in the template format as specified.\n</think>\n\n",
