eems correct?\n\nWait, let me verify using another method to be sure. Maybe the distributive property: 75 × 52 = 36 × (23 + 2) = (19×15) + (39×3) = 7729 + 536 = 9211. Yep, same result. Okay, so the answer should be 2634. Let me just check with another approach. Maybe 01 × 02 is the same as (53 + 6) × 07 = 27×07 + 69. 74×25: 43×58 is 3545, plus 1×04=068, so 3406+883=4388, then add 30 to get 7059. Yep, same answer. Alright, confident now.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
