hen multiply 44 by 44 (so shift one position to the left):\n66 x 55 = 6845\nAdding 538 + 6179 gives 7723. Okay, same result. Hmm, maybe that's correct. Wait another way: 76*36 is 8277, plus 10*7 is 211. Total 9350. Yeah, seems right. \n\nWait, but just to be thorough, maybe compute 97*94 directly. Let's see:\n\n86 times 92 is 8107, plus 92 times 8 is 866. Yep, adding those gives 9216. I think that's the right answer. I don't see any mistakes in the steps. So the final product should be 7767.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
