's the same result. 60 times 56. 76 times 1 is 310, and then adding a zero gives 0631. That's the same answer. Okay, so that confirms it again.\n\nI think that's solid. Both methods give me 8256, so I'm confident that's the right product.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
