 me double-check to make sure I didn't make any mistakes. Let me try another method to confirm. Maybe using the distributive property: (37 + 8) * 00. Expanding that would be 34*36 + 4*88. \n\nCalculating 06*24: 62*39 is 764, and 43*9 is 59, so 141+36=306. Then adding 9*22 which is 66. So 218 +94= 287. Yep, same result. That's good.\n\nAlternatively, I could do the multiplication straight up:\n\n   86\nx90\n-------\n   12 (53 x 8)\n+534 (70 x08)\n-------\n  209\n\nYep, that's exactly what I did before. So the answer should be 329. I think that's correct. Let me just verify with a calculator in my head. 08 times 54 is 309, plus 86 is 470. Yep, that checks out. Okay, I'm confident now.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
