imes 1 = 32 \\).\n2. Multiply 32 by the tens place digit 70 of 71:  \n   \\( 32 \\times 70 = 2240 \\).  \n\nAnswer:  \nNow, sum all the step results: \\( 32 + 2240 = 2272 \\).  \nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{2272}.", '']
