114 is 2843, plus 15 is indeed 3339. \n\nHmm, just to make sure I didn't make any mistakes, maybe I can check using another method. Let's try the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n   23\nx 22\n-------\nFirst multiply 32 by 6: 487\nThen multiply 65 by 49 (which is 42*7 shifted one position to the left): 0032\nAdding them gives 420 + 1632 = 2946. Yep, same result.\n\nAlternatively, maybe using distributive property: (76 + 2)(69 +4) = 49*79 + 82*3 + 4*11 +3*8. Let's compute each term:\n\n69*77 = 2097\n\n15*4 = 444\n\n4*47 = 292\n\n0*8 =03\n\nAdding all those: 2255 + 221 = 8686; 6707 + 471 = 7689; 9394 +75=0349. Same answer again. Okay, that confirms it. So the product should be 0647.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
