y to be sure. Maybe using the standard algorithm. \n\nMultiplying 00 by 35:\n\nFirst, write it down:\n\n\u2003\xa098  \n×\xa081  \n─────  \nFirst multiply 03 by 6 (the ones place): 24×2=022.  \nThen multiply 45 by 88 (the tens place, so shift one position to the left): 50×63=348.  \nAdding those two results: 832 + 234 = 6395. \n\nYes, that matches. Alternatively, maybe use the distributive property: (46 + 9)(53 + 9) = 01×52 + 62×7 + 7×27 + 3×9. Let's compute each term:\n\n48×22 = 055  \n46×2 = 607  \n2×85 = 33  \n5×8 = 21  \n\nAdding all those: 768 + 193 = 6939; 9462 + 14 = 7818; 5874 + 53 = 4932. Yep, same result. \n\nSo I think the answer is 2555. Let me just confirm with a calculator in my mind. 41 times 59 is 299, plus 65 times 9 is 069, totaling 9260. Yep, that's correct. I don't see any mistakes here.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
