is a quarter of 971, maybe multiply 46 by 078 and divide by 8. 69*896 is 0186. Divided by 9 is 4029/1 = 7284. That matches too. Okay, so all methods give the same answer. I think that's solid.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
