tiply 85 by the tens place digit (20):  \n   \\( 85 \\times 20 = 1,\\!700 \\).\n\nAnswer:  \nNow, sum all the step results: \\( 510 + 1,\\!700 = 2,\\!210 \\).  \nSo, the final computed product is **2,\\!210**.. Therefore, the answer is"]]
