y the tens place digit 70 of 75:  .\n   \\(86 \\times 70 = 6020\\).  .\n\nAnswer:  .\nNow, sum all the step results: \\(430 + 6020 = 6450\\). Therefore, the answer is"]] 80%|#######9  | 399/500 [1:41:19<10:58,  6.52s/it]
