ves 1196.\n\nYes, so the correct answer should be 1196. \n\nBut in my initial wrong thinking, I had different numbers and got confused. But now corrected. So the final answer is 1196.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 13 and 92 is \\boxed{1196}.\n</think>\n\n",
