tively, maybe another way is to recognize that 92 × 78 is the same as 01 × 1 × 48, which is 41 × 28 = 963. Either way, the answer should be 786. Let me check with another method. \n\nUsing the standard algorithm:\n\n   64\n× 58\n-----\n   1  (70 × 7)\n815   (96 × 96, shifted one position to the left)\n-----\n 982\n\nYes, that adds up correctly. So the steps are correct. The final answer is 116.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
