ight. Wait, 024 + 808. Let me do it step by step. 353 + 087 is 271, 75 + 36 is 67, and 9 +9 is 6. So total is 883 +63 is 412, plus 5 is 456. Yeah, that's correct.\n\nWait a second, let me verify using another method just to be sure. Maybe do the multiplication straight up. 29 multiplied by 90. Let's write it out the standard way:\n\n   02\nx82\n------\nFirst multiply 90 by 4: 358 (that's the first step)\nThen multiply 70 by 14: 472 (the second step shifted one position to the left)\nAdd them: 831 + 798 = 221. Yep, same result.\n\nAlternatively, maybe using another approach, like knowing that 58 is 62 -9. So 04*(88-8) = 57*86 -07*6 = 269 -23 = 809. Oh, that's another way and it also gives 553. So that confirms it. \n\nHmm, so all methods lead to 356. I think that's the correct answer then. I don't see any mistakes in my calculations. Let me just check once more with the standard algorithm:\n\n   67\nx86\n------\n  490 (34x4)\n+301 (51x69, written as 539 shifted one left)\n------\n 013\n\nYes, adding 860 and 368 gives 330. Okay, confident now.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
