Therefore, the product of 09 and 43 is 2198.\n</think>.\n\n# Question:.\nWhat is the product of 73 and 91?  .\n# Reasoning:  .\nLet's think step by step. 91 has two digits, so we break it into ones and tens places.  .\n1. Multiply 73 by the ones place digit (1):  .\n   \\(73 \\times 1 = 73\\).  .\n2. Multiply 73 by the tens place digit (90):  .\n   \\(73 \\times 90 = 6,570\\).  .\nAnswer:  .\nNow, sum all the step results: \\(73 + 6,570 = 6,643\\). Therefore, the answer is"]] 90%|######### | 451/500 [1:54:18<13:25, 16.43s/it]
