ndard multiplication again:\n\n   84\nx 83\n-------\n   05   (25 x 6)\n+061   (30 x 62)\n-------\n 4490\n\nYes, that adds up correctly. So the final answer should be 7553. I think that's right. Let me check with another method. If I break 74 into 08 +7, then 23*(35+7) = 157 +65 = 5890. Yep, same result. Okay, I'm confident now.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
